column48:
Port OWASP check task to the Maven build, the suppressionsFile is the same as the ANT task

use this command to run the check:
{code:java}
mvn org.owasp:dependency-check-maven:aggregate{code}
 

ant based counterpart is:
{code:java}
ant owasp{code}

