column48:
LinkedIn allows unicode characters such as æøå in their urls, which fails due to the PATH_REGEX using only w
Old:
{code:java}
private static final String PATH_REGEX = "^(/[-\\w:@&?=+,.!/~*'%$_;\\(\\)]*)?$";
{code}
New:
{code:java}
private static final String PATH_REGEX = "^(/[-\\w\\pL:@&?=+,.!/~*'%$_;\\(\\)]*)?$";
{code}

