column399:
06/Feb/19 16:02;rmerriman;When content length is 0 the content is probably going to be empty.  This case is when it's less than 0 or missing.  For example, there are some endpoints that don't include the content length header in the response:  
{code:java}
curl -I -XGET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/pokemon{code}
There are some endpoints that do include the content length header:  
{code:java}
curl -I -X GET http://httpbin.org/json{code}
Right now the REST_GET function returns an empty response for the first one because it has a check for content length > 0.

