 Can we add end to end robot test to make sure whether this header parsing and validation is happening correctly or not. Already we have tests which configure s3 robot tests.(Where we have configured, some random values, now this can be set using crateS3secret) Or to have a more robust testing, we can have all S3 tests run with secure cluster. I think 2nd approach will be good to have.
