column403:
29/Jan/19 10:17;mxm;{quote}
I do notice that the lines 18:54:04 INFO: Unbounded Flink Source 12/16 is reading from sources: only include 1/16 through 15/16. Not that I have any idea if that indicates a problem.
{quote}

That is indeed strange. We should see 0-15. The output is a bit misleading because it is zero-based. However, I see 16 outputs on the first failing build: https://builds.apache.org/job/beam_PostCommit_Java_Nexmark_Flink/1688/consoleFull

I think I know what is wrong here. The test pipelines do not shutdown correctly because the default shutdown behavior in streaming mode changed. Should use the TestFlinkRunner. Will open a PR.

